# A filled-in copy of the template. The blank one is committed as 模板文件.txt and is the file
# that gets handed to other people, so do not write your own details into it. Personal copies
# keep the names below and stay out of the repository.
/resume-profile.txt
/resume-profile.*.txt
/简历模板信息文件.txt
/简历模板信息文件.*.txt
# What 「导出资料」 downloads. A different name from the blank template on purpose, so
# exporting can never overwrite the template people share.
/简历资料导出.txt
/简历资料导出*.txt

# Personal values (name, phone, school...) used by 测试/verify-local-profile.ps1 for the
# reverse leak scan. Never commit this file.
personal-values.local.txt
*.personal.txt
/测试/verify-local-profile.ps1

# Packaged builds are regenerated by tools/pack.ps1, not versioned.
*.zip
exports/
attachments/
local-data/
*.local.json
tmp/
.DS_Store
/测试/browser.local.txt
# Smoke-test scratch space: browser profiles, dumped DOM and captured stderr.
/测试/输出/
/tools/__pycache__/

# Raw captures of other companies' pages and front-end bundles, kept only while transcribing a
# site's column wording. They are third-party code and run to several megabytes, so they do not
# belong in the repository. The small derived lists beside them do: iguopin-labels.txt,
# misses.txt and profile-keys.json are what the transcription actually produced.
/测试/抓取/*.html
/测试/抓取/*.js
